      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "**MEMORANDUM**\n\n**To:** All Employees\n\n**From:** [Your Name]\n\n**Subject:** Balancing Free Speech and a Respectful Workplace\n\nOur company values diversity, inclusion, and respect for all employees. To maintain a positive and productive work environment, we encourage open discussion and collaboration among team members. However, we also acknowledge the importance of individual freedom of expression regarding politics. In light of recent tensions, our company has established guidelines to ensure all employees feel comfortable expressing themselves while also respecting others' views.\n\n**Policy Overview:** Employees are free to express their personal opinions and engage in discussions about politics during their personal time outside of work or during designated company-sponsored events. In the workplace, we expect respectful communication and avoid discussions that might be perceived as divisive or harassing towards others. All employees are entitled to their individual opinions, and we tolerate no retaliation or reprisals against those whose opinions differ from their colleagues.\n\n**Best Practices for Inclusive Communication:**\n\n- Engage in respectful conversations about politics during designated times or outside of work.\n- Refrain from workplace discussions aimed at persuading orcontaminating others' opinions.\n- Recognize and appreciate diverse perspectives, acknowledging the right to hold differing views.\n- Report any concerns or",
